  "POST /pulls/:number/merge requires maintainer access. AI actors cannot merge into main. If the base is checked out, the service requires a clean working copy and applies the merged snapshot to the database. If another branch is checked out, it updates the base ref without replacing that current working database. Merges may fast-forward or create a merge commit; inspect ancestry rather than assuming two parents.": "POST /pulls/:number/merge 需要维护者访问权限。 AI 演员无法合并到 main 中。如果签出基础，该服务需要一个干净的工作副本并将合并的快照应用到数据库。如果签出另一个分支，它会更新基本引用，而不替换当前工作数据库。合并可以快进或创建合并提交；检查血统而不是假设有两个父母。",
  "POST /vcs/restore takes a rev and optional paths. It requires maintainer access and a clean working copy, and creates a new commit containing the earlier content. It does not reset the branch backward and erase intervening commits. The service then applies the new HEAD to the working database.": "POST /vcs/restore 采用 rev 和可选路径。它需要维护者访问权限和干净的工作副本，并创建包含早期内容的新提交。它不会向后重置分支并删除干预提交。然后该服务将新的 HEAD 应用到工作数据库。",
