  "Per-installation signing secret for session and link tokens.": "会话和链接令牌的每次安装签名密钥。",
  "Per-operation process overrides can include RPM, feed, plunge feed, stepdown, stepover, coolant, and radial engagement. Missing values come from material/cutter/machine cutting data. Stepover is a percentage from # to #; stepdown and feeds are positive. The artifact records overridden fields separately from computed parameters so a reviewer can see where process choices came from.": "每个操作过程的超控可包括 RPM、进给、切入进给、降压、步距、冷却液和径向啮合。缺失值来自材料/刀具/机器切削数据。步距是从 # 到 # 的百分比；降压和进给均为正值。工件记录与计算参数分开的覆盖字段，以便审阅者可以看到流程选择的来源。",
