  "Persistence validation": "持久性验证",
  "Persistent data includes the SQLite database and migration backups, file storage, AI credential/configuration state, authentication secret and revocation records, plugin assets, and companion certificates. Protect the whole application data directory when backing it up or transferring an installation. The sidecar owns connection lifetime; clients own neither the SQLite handle nor the main bearer token's issuance.": "持久数据包括 SQLite 数据库和迁移备份、文件存储、AI 凭证/配置状态、身份验证秘密和撤销记录、插件资产和配套证书。备份或传输安装时保护整个应用程序数据目录。 Sidecar拥有连接生命周期；客户端既不拥有 SQLite 句柄，也不拥有主要不记名令牌的发行。",
  "Persistent design or manufacturing data": "持久的设计或制造数据",
  "Phone Settings → Unpair this phone deletes the local saved pairing and returns to Connect. It does not call the desktop revoke endpoint. Use both actions when retiring a device. To rotate only the device credential, revoke it and issue a new pairing; replacing the whole certificate also changes every phone's pin.": "电话设置 → 取消与此电话配对会删除本地保存的配对并返回到“连接”。它不会调用桌面撤销端点。停用设备时使用这两个操作。要仅轮换设备凭证，请将其撤销并发出新的配对；更换整个证书也会更改每部手机的 PIN 码。",
