  "Plugin id": "插件 ID",
  "Plugin inputs are the declared argument object; unlike built-in grouped tools, this read plugin does not require an action discriminator inside input. The bridge wraps the returned value with tool/action metadata; the action is run. Function-level ok=false remains a readable result rather than an HTTP transport success proving a useful coordinate list.": "插件输入是声明的参数对象；与内置分组工具不同，此读取插件不需要输入内部的动作鉴别器。桥用工具/操作元数据包装返回值；操作已运行。函数级别的 ok=false 仍然是一个可读的结果，而不是证明有用的坐标列表的 HTTP 传输成功。",
