  "Plugin reference": "插件参考",
  "Plugin registry, package installation, configuration, enable/disable, and served plugin assets.": "插件注册表、包安装、配置、启用/禁用以及提供插件资源。",
  "Plugin stops answering after an error": "插件在出现错误后停止应答",
