  "Plugin that exposes CADCAMFUN to the nikcli agent": "将 CADCAMFUN 暴露给 nikcli 代理的插件",
  "PluginRegistryEntry and PluginConfiguration from the migrations: configurations reference registry entries.": "迁移中的 PluginRegistryEntry 和 PluginConfiguration：配置引用注册表项。",
  "Plugins": "插件",
  "Plugins operations in #D": "#D 中的插件操作",
  "Plugins that crash three times within ten minutes are disabled automatically, and an assistant tool call is stopped after # seconds. Both values are constants in": "十分钟内崩溃 3 次的插件会自动禁用，辅助工具调用会在 # 秒后停止。两个值都是常数",
  "Pocket toolpath: # × # mm, # mm deep, Ø# end mill": "型腔刀具路径：# × # mm，深 # mm，Ø# 立铣刀",
  "Point IDs that can still move, and circle IDs whose radius can still change.": "仍可移动的点 ID，以及半径仍可更改的圆 ID。",
  "Point a client at a sidecar without credentials: it exercises the full SSE path and the error branch with no cost.": "将客户端指向没有凭据的 sidecar：它可以免费执行完整的 SSE 路径和错误分支。",
  "Pointer positions are converted to world coordinates before tool dispatch. Snapping combines the spatial index, geometric candidates, and a camera-dependent grid; the selection hit tolerance corresponds to eight screen pixels. Tool machines produce commands and previews rather than writing files or calling the API.": "在工具调度之前，指针位置会转换为世界坐标。捕捉结合了空间索引、几何候选和依赖于相机的网格；选择命中容差对应于八个屏幕像素。工具机生成命令和预览，而不是编写文件或调用 API。",
  "Points are the unknowns. Every line, circle and arc refers to points by id, so two lines that share an end share the point and move together. A circle adds one more unknown, its radius. An arc is a centre and two points on the circle, counter-clockwise from": "点是未知数。每条直线、圆和弧都通过 id 引用点，因此共享端点的两条线共享该点并一起移动。圆又增加了一个未知数，即它的半径。圆弧是圆上的一个圆心和两个点，从",
  "Policies in": "政策",
  "Polygon triangulation": "多边形三角剖分",
  "Polyline": "折线",
  "Polylines with": "折线与",
  "Portable document contract": "便携式文件合同",
  "Portable documents are validated and matched to their NC. Editing code can remove stale evidence or require reparsing. New kernel artifacts are rechecked against captured source requests; arbitrary client-supplied verification claims are not accepted as proof. Owner/ADMIN/MANAGER restrictions also apply to saving portable programs into a project.": "便携式文档经过验证并与其 NC 相匹配。编辑代码可以删除陈旧的证据或需要重新分析。根据捕获的源请求重新检查新的内核工件；客户提供的任意验证声明不被接受作为证据。所有者/管理员/管理员限制也适用于将可移植程序保存到项目中。",
  "Português (Brasil)": "葡萄牙语（巴西）",
  "Positive cutting and plunge feeds.": "正向切削和切入进给。",
  "Positive depth below the stock top.": "股票顶部下方的正深度。",
  "Positive depth per pass.": "每次走刀深度为正。",
  "Positive path tolerance; native default #.# mm.": "正路径公差；本机默认值 #.# 毫米。",
  "Positive replay cell size; controls the stock evidence's spatial resolution.": "正重放细胞大小；控制库存证据的空间分辨率。",
  "Positive, at most # mm; asks the planner to add supported top-edge chamfer work.": "正数，最多 # mm；要求规划人员添加受支持的顶边倒角作业。",
  "Positive, at most # mm; default #.# mm for native finishing.": "正数，最多 # mm；默认为 #.# mm，用于本机整理。",
  "Post": "邮政",
  "Post processors and output options": "后处理器和输出选项",
  "Post-processors": "后处理器",
  "Posts are registered by ID in": "帖子是通过ID注册的",
  "Posts share an emitter with fixed-decimal formatting, comment sanitization, tool changes, arc handling, optional line numbering, and cycle expansion. Defaults are three decimal places, canned cycles enabled, IJK arcs, header enabled, and #.# mm tolerance. Unsupported arc formats fall back through the dialect's supported forms and linearization.": "帖子共享一个具有固定十进制格式、注释清理、工具更改、弧处理、可选行编号和循环扩展的发射器。默认值为小数点后三位、启用固定循环、IJK 圆弧、启用标头以及 #.# mm 公差。不支持的弧格式通过方言支持的形式和线性化进行回退。",
  "Practical guides": "实用指南",
  "Pre-migration backup name": "迁移前备份名称",
  "Pre-release checklist": "预发布清单",
  "Prefer parameters and expressions (": "首选参数和表达式 (",
  "Prefer the generated clients in TypeScript: they know each operation's success status and declared error statuses, and treat anything else as": "更喜欢 TypeScript 中生成的客户端：它们知道每个操作的成功状态和声明的错误状态，并将其他任何内容视为",
  "Prefer the relevant settings or feature control over clearing all webview storage. That storage can also contain session/editor handoffs. A visual preference reset is not a database repair procedure.": "优先选择相关设置或功能控制而不是清除所有 webview 存储。该存储还可以包含会话/编辑器切换。视觉首选项重置不是数据库修复过程。",
  "Preferences and settings": "首选项和设置",
  "Preferred origin: the best private address of the desktop and the gateway port.": "首选来源：桌面的最佳私有地址和网关端口。",
  "Prepare a reviewable change": "准备可审查的变更",
  "Prepare machining resources": "准备加工资源",
  "Presence": "在场",
  "Presence of a configured value is not the same as a working external integration. Read the service result after making a change. Configuration values with a default should be distinguished from optional values for which the receiving service decides its fallback.": "配置值的存在与工作外部集成不同。更改后读取服务结果。具有默认值的配置值应与接收服务决定其回退的可选值区分开来。",
